{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c19b4f2a-9f31-4c5d-8a6e-2b0c1f3e9a11",
    "name": "PaTodo API",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints del backend PaTodo (Spring Boot + MongoDB Atlas).\n\nTODA solicitud autenticada usa el token guardado automáticamente en la variable `accessToken` tras un login exitoso (`POST /auth/login`).\n\nVariables:\n- `baseUrl`: base de la API (incluye el context-path `/api`). Por defecto usa el puerto 8081 porque el 8080 suele estar ocupado en este equipo.\n- `accessToken`: se llena automáticamente en el login.\n- `jobId`: se llena con el primer trabajo del listado para reutilizarlo en los detalles.\n\nRegla en el repo: esta colección se debe actualizar cada vez que un endpoint se agregue, elimine o modifique (ver AGENTS.md).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8081/api" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "jobId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registro y login. Devuelven access token (Bearer).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Carlos\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Orozco\",\n  \"email\": \"carlos@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"phone\": \"+50212345678\",\n  \"role\": \"client\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "register"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Registro exitoso\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"carlos@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login exitoso\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", json.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "event": []
    },
